<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: CZECH VODNI STAVBY JAN-SEPT PROFIT FALLS.</title>
<headline>CZECH VODNI STAVBY JAN-SEPT PROFIT FALLS.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results for nine</p>
<p>months ending September 30, 1996:</p>
<p>(in milions of crowns)</p>
<p> Gross profit		  173.325     vs     206.162</p>
<p> Operating profit	    206.658     vs     228.189</p>
<p>Sales of own goods</p>
<p> and services		3,572.059     vs    2,192.003</p>
<p> Total assets		4,630.380     vs    5,833.844</p>
<p> Basic capital	     1,850.796     vs    1,850.796</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the construction firm is Vodni Stavby</p>
<p>Praha a.s. . Figures were provided by the company</p>
<p>itself. Vodni Stavby is listed on the main market of the Prague</p>
<p>Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 42-2-2423-0003</p>
</text>
